{"path":"/zh/patterns/a2-plan-and-execute/cases/liangbo/","title":"A2 · 规划执行 · 东方屹腾执行型 Agent","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-116e9fb39c1d9358-1","revision":"116e9fb39c1d9358e3cf3f8b1ce31b56b83ac49b515415f121e4e0cd86d937df","tag":"p","quote":"模式矩阵/A2 规划执行/蓝皮书"},{"block_id":"adps-f5d43faad61e94c7-1","revision":"f5d43faad61e94c739ee46787be849cfc3e7fc8ebb9fc3543611c8a999203b9b","tag":"table","quote":"字段 值 主模式 A2 规划执行 Plan-and-Execute（行动 × 编排） 结合模式 A1 工具调度 · G1 审批门 · M3 进度追踪 案例 上海东方屹腾科技 · HR/薪酬 SaaS · 服务 2 万+ 企业 · 执行型 Agent 对应白皮书 /zh/patterns/a2-plan-and-execute/ 源 梁博 AICon 逐字稿第五章 · PPT 16–19 页 工程结论 把严格步骤依赖写入任务 DAG，由状态机调度、验收和恢复；ReAct 负责探索，规划执行负责已明确的流程。"},{"block_id":"adps-2cf0822c110c187f-1","revision":"2cf0822c110c187f6a1ce0d6206715ca1aed0f4518021bd61eaa0e3232e24080","tag":"p","quote":"薪资组快速搭建包含四个连续步骤："},{"block_id":"adps-4a138a6512e1c0b4-1","revision":"4a138a6512e1c0b4e4d2777f63a5c702fd682995d0c14fc5c14976e9a9642b78","tag":"li","quote":"根据用户诉求匹配薪资组模板；"},{"block_id":"adps-99ee6ad5fad86449-1","revision":"99ee6ad5fad864490d2609b7250db4bbe4aba7adba29f42650786218d12245b2","tag":"li","quote":"为企业现有薪资组数据建立快照；"},{"block_id":"adps-3000798813b18f14-1","revision":"3000798813b18f14d60b90673dda4b71fe0e576932665bf7a2d393ddae2261d3","tag":"li","quote":"导入失败时使用快照回滚。"},{"block_id":"adps-b53a9f3af2288340-1","revision":"b53a9f3af22883409f5e7dd9c67a3da06c71f8e380ce1b93438950fa71d36e0e","tag":"p","quote":"步骤之间存在严格依赖。团队曾把这套顺序写入 Skill，再交给 ReAct 逐步执行。模拟测试中出现过跨步和漏步，说明叙事说明不能代替调度约束。"},{"block_id":"adps-0045bab4231919e4-1","revision":"0045bab4231919e4526b87e9c28c9b829a3c7434f38dda4b6b9ca1b6e6c7a822","tag":"p","quote":"ReAct 和规划执行承担不同任务："},{"block_id":"adps-6595733a0149ae31-1","revision":"6595733a0149ae31f0a74bb89ab09b10e75900ebdd1e10c23b69d730232afaec","tag":"table","quote":"模式 适用状态 控制结构 ReAct 目标仍需探索，下一步依赖最新观察 带退出条件的循环 规划执行 步骤及依赖已经明确 DAG 与节点状态机"},{"block_id":"adps-852d969ccff1abe3-1","revision":"852d969ccff1abe3775a6344b1bbdac3cebb34300f3055bad154ac64a7c4445a","tag":"p","quote":"ReAct 在任务结构明确后把控制权交还 Orchestrator。Orchestrator 创建或更新任务图，再进入规划执行。工具失败或新证据改变前提时，执行器可以触发局部 replan，无需重写整个计划。"},{"block_id":"adps-4c984b7107010ff3-1","revision":"4c984b7107010ff3d7449e9f35acdb25cb91e3555c07c528ba5f2eb502da52d4","tag":"p","quote":"任务 DAG 保存节点及其依赖。节点至少包含目标、状态、前置依赖、验收条件和执行结果引用。"},{"block_id":"adps-dca2ec5ac0f73139-1","revision":"dca2ec5ac0f7313959478e3456a690b36ad5d8285346f0e870f003e96002e6f7","tag":"pre","quote":"type TaskStatus string const ( Pending TaskStatus = \"pending\" Ready TaskStatus = \"ready\" InProgress TaskStatus = \"in_progress\" AwaitingApproval TaskStatus = \"awaiting_approval\" Completed TaskStatus = \"completed\" Failed TaskStatus = \"failed\" Blocked TaskStatus = \"blocked\" ) type TaskNode struct { ID string Goal string DependsOn []string Status TaskStatus Acceptance []Criterion ResultRef string }"},{"block_id":"adps-1cd2a7c37df5805e-1","revision":"1cd2a7c37df5805e865c1e0dc5be06ccb068691eb79df8540434a9ca5ef3957e","tag":"p","quote":"一个节点只有在所有依赖节点均为 completed、自身前置条件通过时，才能从 pending 进入 ready。执行器领取 ready 节点后置为 in_progress，验收器根据业务回执决定进入 completed、failed 或 blocked。"},{"block_id":"adps-3c2ad441c7127186-1","revision":"3c2ad441c7127186ab1dc04d8e382113affba5d1013ddd785c3ed50b1a0238f2","tag":"li","quote":"Planner：把业务目标转换为任务图，声明依赖和验收条件；"},{"block_id":"adps-24661d1032a917da-1","revision":"24661d1032a917da3b5c4dd7f09c7d1f0420b6242b032da6f212d696482f87d0","tag":"li","quote":"Scheduler：根据依赖和状态选择可运行节点；"},{"block_id":"adps-7274ab7984b100c9-1","revision":"7274ab7984b100c982c0fc9ad5681246b43f98b3e8475ea73f47ead81fbdd820","tag":"li","quote":"Executor：通过 A1 工具调度执行节点；"},{"block_id":"adps-f4787b709f90a830-1","revision":"f4787b709f90a83085c779fabec35bab013650eaad2fd3ba80ff0371a5b0630e","tag":"li","quote":"Validator：核对回执、业务状态和节点验收条件；"},{"block_id":"adps-5f75fb091a025f3d-1","revision":"5f75fb091a025f3d8b5cadfd2b87933c62b2a1062e15ef4307ab2bebe952876c","tag":"li","quote":"Workspace：持久化任务图和状态迁移；"},{"block_id":"adps-20d51861debe1c50-1","revision":"20d51861debe1c50d1549fedce6d69fa9872197f31aeaef9c9ea484259780828","tag":"li","quote":"Orchestrator：管理 ReAct、规划执行和人工审批之间的控制权。"},{"block_id":"adps-6ef46118c95a24ed-1","revision":"6ef46118c95a24edc91af96878104a533890c8c53b981ac7a50bb38b01d8aa47","tag":"p","quote":"独立节点可以并行执行，有依赖的节点按拓扑顺序推进。调度方式与 Airflow、Prefect 等 DAG 系统相近，但节点内容可以由 Agent 在运行中生成或局部修订。"},{"block_id":"adps-d09bc5df0f120851-1","revision":"d09bc5df0f120851c4db5c1cbdb1a551eb974624826b38219e4c4c9dcc3d2fe1","tag":"p","quote":"Checkpoint 至少保存任务图版本、节点状态、已完成结果引用和当前控制权。恢复时，调度器重新计算可运行节点，不依赖模型复述此前步骤。"},{"block_id":"adps-e97d74b64110f0f4-1","revision":"e97d74b64110f0f4fc28b0054b0202f6b6e9ffd3d9219f76b815b7f29abaab2f","tag":"p","quote":"局部 replan 只替换受失败影响的子图，并保留已验收节点及其业务回执。计划版本写入事件日志，便于追溯“哪个计划产生了这次执行”。"},{"block_id":"adps-5019f3082adf1433-1","revision":"5019f3082adf1433ac1ae00cd15eedf547bc916f69f88291604465b8b528b768","tag":"p","quote":"敏感节点可以在执行前进入 awaiting_approval。审批通过后转为 ready，拒绝后转为 blocked 或触发替代计划。由于任务状态机已经保存中断点和依赖，HITL 不需要单独维护一套恢复机制。相关设计见 G1 审批门切片。"},{"block_id":"adps-b52bc08c2c974909-1","revision":"b52bc08c2c9749094f1c532edbe5aedbe56b450601e99daf93e2cc1e1618f1f7","tag":"li","quote":"计划只是一段文本，没有可执行的节点 ID、依赖和验收条件；"},{"block_id":"adps-d4cbbbaa5403588f-1","revision":"d4cbbbaa5403588f418eab8f141aefc629d70a8fab1bf653e33118c38b9eebca","tag":"li","quote":"计划生成后不再更新，工具失败只能从头重跑；"},{"block_id":"adps-f6508c4645f1f0a1-1","revision":"f6508c4645f1f0a13b5f8ce15692c9d840ac1c9d6e78e34dd1fa37e88dbe8e58","tag":"li","quote":"节点完成仅依据模型判断，没有核对业务回执；"},{"block_id":"adps-12b191fb6312ee16-1","revision":"12b191fb6312ee169c845397887c5ce289a040714eb3646c5f514ce5b278e71f","tag":"li","quote":"调度状态、业务参数和叙事摘要混在同一结构中；"},{"block_id":"adps-52bf493aa1838ad7-1","revision":"52bf493aa1838ad7a6d02c7937a1ad138798c0cddc3cebe63733af4ceb9a635b","tag":"li","quote":"并行节点共享可变状态，却没有作用域和冲突检测；"},{"block_id":"adps-5264f4884678f333-1","revision":"5264f4884678f333dc1e9e686c3797bb3f924bdcc8fa20966f510601dbd1d423","tag":"li","quote":"审批只暂停界面，没有持久化任务节点与恢复位置。"},{"block_id":"adps-3cf4ed2a3c985b18-1","revision":"3cf4ed2a3c985b18bb0a38fb10095d3c0a1b84406b6fe78031cc1897ad011bc1","tag":"li","quote":"跨步、漏步和重复执行次数；"},{"block_id":"adps-006522f9cb3840f2-1","revision":"006522f9cb3840f242e96cad9a8f79771e98a78c7222d374e41d3ef1bc971f97","tag":"li","quote":"节点验收条件的回执覆盖率；"},{"block_id":"adps-bba88ef22aae7c54-1","revision":"bba88ef22aae7c5422bd7552615c78a6d7d52dfffe1610910073300680fdf200","tag":"li","quote":"失败后局部 replan 的范围与恢复时间；"},{"block_id":"adps-5c188cdb571849ce-1","revision":"5c188cdb571849ce62b73ca02b92720753cf012bc4c768bf4658ffd5c0f2e14a","tag":"li","quote":"Checkpoint 恢复后任务图的一致性；"},{"block_id":"adps-4f4d18cd7a1115c0-1","revision":"4f4d18cd7a1115c075646837a627be9bf272cd201d201114ae965c0edd6a9ac1","tag":"li","quote":"可并行节点的实际并发率；"},{"block_id":"adps-ddb62e15730f1f02-1","revision":"ddb62e15730f1f02a551a2d05f01f6b9d59e3331eb1f7abaf002317c224ebde7","tag":"li","quote":"审批恢复后重复副作用次数。"},{"block_id":"adps-e70a1f48b1400b07-1","revision":"e70a1f48b1400b079e2fe2f901a1a41610e7f135329a06b0610469a918d224e1","tag":"p","quote":"任务步骤明确、步骤间有严格依赖，且顺序错误会造成交付失败或数据损坏时，应采用规划执行。任务图、状态机和 Checkpoint 的成本由错误代价来决定。"},{"block_id":"adps-ebd620bb3f9193c5-1","revision":"ebd620bb3f9193c5141f66194d0dc39000c6487ad8d8a230d001fff239a7f66f","tag":"p","quote":"资料检索、总结和报告生成等松散流程可以使用 ReAct 或提示链。此类任务通常不需要为每一步维护持久化节点状态。"},{"block_id":"adps-b8a4a0c144b61e9b-1","revision":"b8a4a0c144b61e9bbdb47ed87a12773a8a31604a9d48913496eacf8a95427b9a","tag":"p","quote":"规划执行中的每个节点继续使用 A1 工具调度切片 的注册协议和机械状态坐标。"},{"block_id":"adps-623fb907cd095597-1","revision":"623fb907cd0955970f94017b2be86c9defc75272440f90bb410043bca7cd8f3b","tag":"p","quote":"引用建议：ADPS、梁博，《东方屹腾 · 规划执行》，企业 Agent 系统蓝皮书 v0.4，2026-08-02。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-79480e7125ad6903-1","revision":"79480e7125ad690354825fcdaaf560618dbc0f310b5df40f3f9e4ed205348fd8","tag":"p","quote":"证据边界：本页是完整案例的模式切片，记录特定系统约束下的实现选择。案例方提供的实现与效果信息未经过独立审计，不构成通用性能承诺。"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
